make message "I cannot access my account. Please help immediately."
judge message by jev "The customer requests urgent help" called urgency
show urgency

classify message by jev "Which team should handle this request?" called team:
  "access": "Login or account access"
  "billing": "Payments or invoices"
  "other": "Neither account access nor billing"
show team

score message by jev "How urgent is this request?" called priority:
  0: "No urgency"
  1: "Some urgency"
  2: "Immediate assistance requested"
show priority
